nd piece of raw meat.\n   - Action: `open(grill_lid)`\n   - Pick the second piece of raw meat.\n   - Action: `pick(raw_meat_1)` (assuming the second piece is also named `raw_meat_1`)\n   - Place the second piece inside the grill.\n   - Action: `place(raw_meat_1, inside_grill)`\n   - Close the grill lid.\n   - Action: `close(grill_lid)`\n\n6. **Serve the Cooked Meat on the Plate**:\n   - After the meat is cooked, we need to serve it on the plate in the serving area.\n   - Action: `open(grill_lid)` (to access the cooked meat)\n   - Pick the cooked meat.\n   - Action: `pick(raw_meat_1)` (assuming the cooked meat is still named `raw_meat_1`)\n   - Place the cooked meat on the plate in the serving area.\n   - Action: `place(raw_meat_1, dish_rack)`\n   - Close the grill lid.\n   - Action: `close(grill_lid)`\n\n### Final Actions:\n\nFINAL ACTIONS:\nopen(grill_lid)\npick(raw_meat_1)\nplace(raw_meat_1, inside_grill)\nclose(grill_lid)\nopen(grill_lid)\npick(raw_meat_1)\nplace(raw_meat_1, inside_grill)\nclose(grill_lid)\nopen(grill_lid)\npick(raw_meat_1)\nplace(raw_meat_1, dish_rack)\nclose(grill_lid)", "reasoning": "", "parsed_output": ["open(grill_lid)", "pick(raw_meat_1)", "place(raw_meat_1, inside_grill)", "close(grill_lid)", "open(grill_lid)", "pick(raw_meat_1)", "place(raw_meat_1, inside_grill)", "close(grill_lid)", "open(grill_lid)", "pick(raw_meat_1)", "place(raw_meat_1, dish_rack)", "close(grill_lid)"], "planner_call_latency_s": 9.728172302246094, "wall_latency_s": 9.7285, "queue_wait_s": null, "generation_time_s": 9.4097, "finish_reason": "stop", "prompt_tokens": 2763, "completion_tokens": 698, "sampling_preset": "vl", "settings_fingerprint": "e8e014b8aeb5c440", "error_message": null, "profile_alias": "internvl3.5-8b", "request_params": {"model": "internvl3.5-8b", "max_tokens": 24576, "temperature": 0.8, "top_p": 0.8, "top_k": -1, "min_p": 0.0, "repetition_penalty": 1.0, "presence_penalty": 0.0}, "exchange_path": "prompts/001_step001_initial.exchange.json", "image_pa